	<content contentuid="h0d1ab7dcg9a42g48a1ga09dg27cf87673a54" version="1">You lose &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;LSTag Tooltip="ProficiencyBonus"&gt;Proficiency Bonus&lt;/LSTag&gt;.&lt;br&gt;When you are attacked, you must pass a &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Charisma"&gt;Charisma&lt;/LSTag&gt; &lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;Saving Throw&lt;/LSTag&gt; (&lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt;) or become &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="FRIGHTENED"&gt;Frightened&lt;/LSTag&gt; for &lt;b&gt;[3]&lt;/b&gt; turns.&lt;br&gt;Killing an enemy raises the Planar Scorch on you by &lt;b&gt;[4]&lt;/b&gt; stage.</content>
	<content contentuid="h72fea054gc582g489eg89b1ge07690fab78e" version="1">You lose &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;LSTag Tooltip="ProficiencyBonus"&gt;Proficiency Bonus&lt;/LSTag&gt;.&lt;br&gt;When you are attacked, you must pass a &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Charisma"&gt;Charisma&lt;/LSTag&gt; &lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;Saving Throw&lt;/LSTag&gt; (&lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt;) or become &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="FRIGHTENED"&gt;Frightened&lt;/LSTag&gt; for &lt;b&gt;[3]&lt;/b&gt; turns.&lt;br&gt;Killing an enemy raises the Planar Scorch on you by &lt;b&gt;[4]&lt;/b&gt; stage.&lt;br&gt;You cannot be healed by the means of the living.</content>
